    "For the probability of a key part being destroyed, should I treat each bomb's destruction probability as independent (so a part hit by multiple bombs has destruction probability 1 minus the product of the per-bomb survival probabilities), or should I use some other rule for combining multiple bombs on the same part?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice regarding how to combine probabilities for multiple bombs hitting the same part."
}

